 collects is shown in the table below. The coordinate system is set up so that the positive horizontal axis is aligned with the East and the positive vertical axis is aligned with the North.\n\n| Time | Coordinates |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $8:00$ am | $(-3, 0)$ |\n| $8:30$ am | $(-5, 2)$ |\n| $9:00$ am | $(-2, 2)$ |\n| $9:30$ am | $(-2, 4)$ |\n| $10:00$ am | $(3, 2)$ |\n| $10:30$ am | $(0,-1)$ |\n\nDuring what time period did he travel North?" "Mark is traveling on his sailboat through a lake. Every $30$ minutes he records his coordinates on a map using a GPS navigator. The data that he collects is shown in the table below. The coordinate system is set up so that the positive horizontal axis is aligned with the East and the positive vertical axis is aligned with the North.\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Time</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Coordinates</th>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\" data-cell-align=\"center\"> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$8:00$ am</td> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$(-3, 0)$</td> </tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\" data-cell-align=\"center\"> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$8:30$ am</td> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$(-5, 2)$</td> </tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\" data-cell-align=\"center\"> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$9:00$ am</td> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$(-2, 2)$</td> </tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\" data-cell-align=\"center\"> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$9:30$ am</td> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$(-2, 4)$</td> </tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\" data-cell-align=\"center\"> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$10:00$ am</td> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$(3, 2)$</td> </tr>\n<tr data-cell-align=\"center\"> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$10:30$ am</td> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$(0,-1)$</td> </tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nDuring what time period did he travel North?"] [:db/cas 17592186148065 :question/problem "The table below shows the coordinates of bus stops in a town. The coordinates are set up so that a difference of one unit corresponds to a distance of $1km$.\n\n| Stop Number | Location | Coordinates |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| $1$ | Depo | $(4, 0)$ |\n| $2$ | Hospital | $(4,-2)$ |\n| $3$ | Theatre | $(2,-2)$ |\n| $4$ | Fire Station | $(2, 3)$ |\n| $5$ | Stadium | $(-3, 3)$ |\n| $6$ | Cinema | $(-3,-4)$ |\n| $7$ | Church | $(0,-4)$ |\n\nIf it takes precisely $5$ minutes for the bus to travel from one bus stop to another, then between which two bus stops is the bus going the fastest?" "The table below shows the coordinates of bus stops in a town. The coordinates are set up so that a difference of one unit corresponds to a distance of $1km$.\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Stop Number</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Location</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Coordinates</th>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\" data-cell-align=\"center\"> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$1$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">Depo</td> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$(4, 0)$</td> </tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\" data-cell-align=\"center\"> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$2$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">Hospital</td> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$(4,-2)$</td> </tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\" data-cell-align=\"center\"> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$3$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">Theatre</td> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$(2,-2)$</td> </tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\" data-cell-align=\"center\"> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$4$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">Fire Station</td> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$(2, 3)$</td> </tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\" data-cell-align=\"center\"> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$5$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">Stadium</td> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$(-3, 3)$</td> </tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\" data-cell-align=\"center\"> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$6$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">Cinema</td> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$(-3,-4)$</td> </tr>\n<tr data-cell-align=\"center\"> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$7$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">Church</td> <td data-cell-align=\"center\">$(0,-4)$</td> </tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nIf it takes precisely $5$ minutes for the bus to travel from one bus stop to another, then between which two bus stops is the bus going the fastest?"]]
